00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:21,000
In Sicily, you stand by the law or by the Mafia. Only
one man ever dared to stand alone.

2
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:36,000
The Sicilian is a drama, crime, thriller film directed by Michael Cimino.

3
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Egocentric bandit Salvatore Giuliano fights the Church, the Mafia, and the landed
gentry while leading a populist movement for Sicilian independence.

4
