9
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:21,000
Camilla, Duchess of Crotone, played by Barbara Sukowa.

10
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:36,000
The Sicilian is a 1987 epic historical crime film directed by Michael Cimino.

11
01:19:45,000 --> 01:19:51,000
The film was adapted by Steve Shagan, and later rewritten by Cimino and
Gore Vidal from Mario Puzo's 1984 novel of the same name.

12
01:27:00,000 --> 01:27:06,000
Christopher Lambert stars as Salvatore Giuliano, the infamous bandit who
tried to liberate early 1950s Sicily from Italian rule.

13
01:34:15,000 --> 01:34:21,000
The film also stars Terence Stamp, Joss Ackland,
John Turturro and Barbara Sukowa.

14
01:41:30,000 --> 01:41:36,000
The film explores themes of sicily, italy, sicilian mafia, sicilian.

15
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:51,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
